        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "あんなに高い手数料をとるなんて、まさに追いはぎのようなやり方だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「そんな価格で売るなんて、追いはぎ同然じゃないか！」と客が怒鳴った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "あの店は品揃えはいいが、値段が追いはぎ並みに高い。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
